# PC card pc-melee-stray-read (BENCH-258): master on twelve census fields with ScalarR seated in place of each field's lowest-ranked robot (work/melee-stray-seat.txt, written by melee_strays.py seat), melee trace on, 1 seed (3361), 20 rounds, no baseline. Template: srprep writes work/melee-stray-seat.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @C@ = the host's melee width.
--suite
work/melee-stray-seat.txt
--seeds
1
--seed-base
3361
--rounds
20
--parallel
@C@
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--melee-trace
true
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.Hadur_@V@aa.jar
--robot
hadur117.Hadur @V@aa
--out
work/melee-stray-seat-@V@
--report
../docs/bench/local/melee-stray-seat-battles.md
